WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.337 --> 00:00:08.708
- STILL SCORELESS WITH ONLY
A FEW MINUTES REMAINING.

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:11.511
TRAVINO PASSES TO FEDERNOIR.

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:13.246
SLIDE TACKLE BY GOZURP.

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:16.115
CLEARLY A FLOP.
NO CONTACT MADE.

00:00:16.148 --> 00:00:19.118
[operatic music playing]

00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:27.093
♪ ♪

00:02:13.532 --> 00:02:15.568
IT ALL COMES DOWN TO THIS
AS THE POWER FALCONS PREPARE

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:16.435
TO TAKE THE FREE KICK.

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:18.304
THIS IS THE LAST CHANCE
TO WIN THE GAME.

00:02:18.337 --> 00:02:22.208
THESE ARE THE DYING SECONDS
OF THE MATCH.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:40.893
AND WHAT IS THIS?
CAN YOU BELIEVE IT?

00:02:40.926 --> 00:02:43.729
FEDERNOIR IS BACK
ON THE PITCH.

00:02:43.762 --> 00:02:45.431
HE'S ALIVE AND TAKING
THE FREE KICK.

00:02:45.464 --> 00:02:47.833
HE SHOOTS. HE SCORES.
OH, MY!

00:02:47.866 --> 00:02:49.835
SO MANY RULES CLEARLY BROKEN
LEADING UP TO THAT GOAL,

00:02:49.868 --> 00:02:51.537
BUT THEY'VE ALLOWED IT.

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:54.507
POWER FALCONS WIN
THIS MATCH!

